{"4550280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dawn of Horror", "steam_appid": 4550280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dawn of Horror</strong> is a fast-paced, brutal cyberpunk <strong>Battle Royale</strong> set in the decaying urban sprawl of Cygnus City, 2221. Following the collapse of civilization into a digital Dark Age, scavengers fight over the remaining ruins. Drop in, gear up, hack the system, and be the last one breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550280/extras/7446f79dbbf42052fed1f06ad5f6856f.avif?t=1787727665\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550280/extras_big/7446f79dbbf42052fed1f06ad5f6856f.webp?t=1787727665 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO MODES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLO— Free-for-all. Last player standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRIO — Squads of three. Last squad standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550280/extras/6741f1cffec88ee13d1c9c8a2596ca03.avif?t=1787727665\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550280/extras_big/6741f1cffec88ee13d1c9c8a2596ca03.webp?t=1787727665 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malice Arsenal - High-caliber weaponry with distinct firing tiers — built for crowd control and elite elimination. Every gun handles like it means it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Lives, Twenty-Five Seconds</strong> - Death isn't the end — it's a countdown. Go down and you're lifted above the sprawl to watch the fight play out, then skydive back in. Three redeploys. Spend them badly and you're ELIMINATED for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Money Economy</strong> - $10 a kill. $30 a magazine. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built in Godot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Made solo in Godot 4 by one developer. Custom netcode, hand-built systems, no engine bloat.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hand-Painted, Not Generated</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every texture painted by hand. No generative AI art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dawn of Horror</strong> is a fast-paced, brutal cyberpunk <strong>Battle Royale</strong> set in the decaying urban sprawl of Cygnus City, 2221. Following the collapse of civilization into a digital Dark Age, scavengers fight over the remaining ruins. Drop in, gear up, hack the system, and be the last one breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550280/extras/7446f79dbbf42052fed1f06ad5f6856f.avif?t=1787727665\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550280/extras_big/7446f79dbbf42052fed1f06ad5f6856f.webp?t=1787727665 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO MODES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLO— Free-for-all. Last player standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRIO — Squads of three. Last squad standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550280/extras/6741f1cffec88ee13d1c9c8a2596ca03.avif?t=1787727665\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550280/extras_big/6741f1cffec88ee13d1c9c8a2596ca03.webp?t=1787727665 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malice Arsenal - High-caliber weaponry with dis